\title{Independent set, independence number}
\taxon{Definition}
\date{2023-10-01}
\author{JB00}
\import{macros}

\p{A set of vertices of a graph #{G = (V, E)} is \em{independent} if no two of its vertices are joined by an edge. The \em{independence number} #{\alpha(G)} of #{G} is the maximal cardinality of an independent set of vertices.}
